==Serbian==
===Proper noun===
'''Србијанац''' {{m}} ({{p}}: '''Србијанци''')

#A [[Serb]]; a citizen of [[Serbia]] (''not necessarily of [[Serb]] ethnicity''); an inhabitant of [[Central Serbia]] (Serbia excluding Vojvodina). The term can be considered derogatory. Noun [[Srbin]] (or [[Srpkinja]] in the feminine case) is to be used instead.

